http://www.helsinki.fi/~vviitane/spoilers/altars , 

only your alignment score matters[1]; if it is positive, you can 
convert the altar.  (I'm on my own here, so if Dylan could confirm 
this claim, I'd rest easier, but I don't see how I could have misread 
the code.)  

Alternately, there is a somewhat tricky way to get holy water with 
a rather high probability, but you need a ? of remove curse for this.  

