[1] If you check in the source of pray.c, you stumble along the condition 
"if (ugod_is_angry()", but that is a misnomer, since actually one finds 
earlier "#define ugod_is_angry() (u.ualign.record < 0)", hence ugod_is_angry() 
is false iff your alignment score is negative.  


